        <p style="text-indent: 4em" rend="first-line-indent(4)" source="#source-69921-69959">『日本歴史地図』</p>
        <p source="#source-69959-70051"><hi rend="text-combine-upright" snh:layout-kind="tcy" source="#source-69959-70004" corresp="#source-69968-70004"><seg source="#source-69959-69968">（二）</seg></hi><seg source="#source-70004-70051">　一九三五・七・二七　　咲枝宛</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-70051-70134">改造社文学全集中＊「漱石」「独歩」「藤村」「長塚節」</p>
